        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </Section>

  <!-- ================================================================ TYPE -->
  <Section id="type" eyebrow="04" title={L('文字', 'Typography')} tone="sunken" lead={L('中文內文用讀者手機裡的系統字型，零下載；只有大標題用思源黑體（Noto Sans TC）最粗的 Black。拉丁字母與數字用 Archivo：一套字、兩種寬度，英文標題與大數字用窄體，像路面上拉長的標字。', 'Chinese body text uses the reader’s own system font: zero download. Only headlines use Noto Sans TC Black. Latin letters and figures are Archivo: one family, two widths, with English headlines and big numbers condensed like elongated lettering on a road.')}>
    <div class="sg-type">
      {[
        ['.display', 'display', L('紅燈亮起的那一刻', 'The moment the light turns red')],
        ['h1', 'h1', L('排氣管離地不到一公尺', 'The tailpipe is under a metre up')],
        ['h2', 'h2', L('這一格，沒有人量過', 'Nobody has measured this')],
        ['h3', 'h3', L('誰在路口站得最久', 'Who stands at the crossing longest')],
        ['h4', 'h4', L('怎麼讀這張圖', 'How to read this chart')],
      ].map(([name, cls, sample]) => (
        <div class="sg-type__row">
          <code>{name}</code>
          <p class={cls}>{sample}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
      <div class="sg-type__row">
        <code>.lead</code>
        <p class="lead">{L('引言用來把一個章節的重點在兩三行內說完，字比內文大一級、顏色淡一級。', 'A lead says what the section is about in two or three lines, one step larger and one step quieter than body text.')}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sg-type__row">
        <code>p (.prose)</code>
        <div class="prose">
          <p set:html={L(
              '內文行高 1.8、每行約 34 個字，標點用全形並採嚴格避頭尾。強調用<em>粗體</em>而不是斜體，因為中文沒有斜體；書名與報告名用《》。數字與英文像 PM2.5、CO、125 cc 前後各留一個半形空格，瀏覽器支援時也會自動補上間距。',
              'Body text is set at a line-height of 1.6 and about 66 characters a line. Emphasis is a real <em>italic</em> in English and bold in Chinese, because Chinese has no italic. Units stay attached to their numbers, such as 125 cc, and dashes — like this one — come from the Latin font in English and from the CJK font in Chinese.',
            )} />
          <p>
            {L('句子裡可以用', 'Inside a sentence you can use ')}<mark>{L('螢光標記', 'a highlight')}</mark>{L('、', ', ')}<a href="#type">{L('連結', 'a link')}</a>{L('、來源標記', ' and a citation marker')}<Cite locale={locale} id="sample-a" n={1} />{L('。單位請用', '. For units use ')}<code>units.ugm3</code>{L(':', ': ')}<span class="nowrap">35 {units.ugm3}</span>{L('。', '.')}
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sg-type__row">
        <code>.meta / .eyebrow</code>
        <div class="stack">
          <p class="eyebrow">{L('小標：一段車道線加一行字', 'Eyebrow: a lane dash, then a label')}</p>
          <p class="meta">{L('註記與圖說用 13px，這是中文可讀的下限，不要再小。', 'Meta and captions are 13px, the floor for legible Chinese. Never go smaller.')}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sg-type__row">
        <code lang="en">{en ? 'lang="zh-Hant"' : 'lang="en"'}</code>
        <div class="prose">
          {en ? (
            <p>A Chinese fragment inside English text carries its own lang attribute, so it gets Chinese punctuation and line-breaking: <span lang="zh-Hant-TW">機車待轉區——等紅燈的地方。</span></p>
          ) : (
            <p>中文頁面裡的英文片段要加上 lang 屬性，才會套用英文的標點與字距：<span lang="en">“Stop line — the place where the pack waits.”</span></p>
          )}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid sg-rules">
      <Callout label={L('標題斷行', 'Headline wrapping')}>
        <p>{L('中文沒有空格，瀏覽器可能把一個詞從中間切開。用 | 標出語意單位，<Phrased> 會讓標題只在單位之間換行。Section、Chapter、Figure 的 title 都直接支援。', 'Chinese has no spaces, so a browser may break a headline mid-word. Mark phrase units with | and <Phrased> only wraps between them. The title prop of Section, Chapter and Figure supports it directly.')}</p>
        <p><code>{L('title="等紅燈的時候，|我們吸進了什麼"', 'title="What we breathe |at the red light"')}</code></p>
      </Callout>
      <Callout label={L('數字', 'Numbers')}>
        <p>{L('內文與大數字用比例數字；表格、座標軸、試算結果用等寬數字（.tnum，table 與 output 已預設）。負號用「−」（U+2212），範圍用「–」。', 'Running text and big numbers use proportional figures; tables, axes and calculator output use tabular figures (.tnum; tables and <output> have it by default). Use a real minus “−” (U+2212) and an en dash for ranges.')}</p>
        <table class="sg-nums"><tbody><tr><td>{L('比例', 'Proportional')}</td><td class="num" style="font-variant-numeric:proportional-nums">1,111.1</td></tr><tr><td>{L('等寬', 'Tabular')}</td><td class="num">1,111.1</td></tr><tr><td></td><td class="num">8,888.8</td></tr></tbody></table>
      </Callout>
      <Callout label={L('字型載入', 'Font loading')}>
        <p>{L('中文網路字型只用在 .display、h1、h2（字重 900）。它切成約一百個 unicode-range 分片，瀏覽器只下載標題用到的那幾片。h3 以下與所有內文都是系統字型，所以最粗只到 700。拉丁字型只有一個檔案，預先載入。', 'The Chinese web font is used only by .display, h1 and h2 (weight 900). It ships as about a hundred unicode-range slices and the browser fetches only the few a page’s headlines need. h3 and below, and all body text, are system fonts, so they stop at weight 700. The Latin font is a single preloaded file.')}</p>
      </Callout>
    </div>
  </Section>

