  <Section id="recipe" eyebrow="08" title={L('怎麼做一個章節', 'How to build a chapter')} rule lead={L('首頁是一個紅燈，每個章節是這 90 秒裡的一拍。手機上一個章節的預算是固定的；超過的東西放到「看這一環的全部證據」後面。', 'The home page is one red light, and each chapter is one beat of its ninety seconds. A chapter has a fixed budget on a phone; anything beyond it goes behind “see all the evidence for this link”.')}>
    <div class="sg-two">
      <div class="prose">
        <ol>
          <li>{L('文案先寫進 src/i18n/pages/home.ts（每個字串中英各一），頁面只負責排版。', 'Write the copy into src/i18n/pages/home.ts first (each string in both languages); the page only lays it out.')}</li>
          <li><b>{L('畫面', 'Frame')}</b>{L('：art 插槽放這一章的那一格靜態畫面，在最上面。手機上沒有東西是釘住的，只有倒數軌。', ': the art slot takes the chapter’s one static frame, at the top. Nothing is pinned on a phone except the rail.')}</li>
          <li><b>{L('小標', 'Kicker')}</b>{L('：把倒數寫成文字（「紅燈 · 剩 64 秒」），沒有 JavaScript 也讀得到。不寫的話會依 count 自動產生。', ': print the count as text (“Red light · 64 seconds left”) so it reads without JavaScript. Leave it out and it is generated from the count.')}</li>
          <li><b>{L('標題', 'Headline')}</b>{L('，再來是', ', then the ')}<b>{L('導言', 'deck')}</b>{L('：最多約 100 個中文字。', ': about 100 Chinese characters at most.')}</li>
          <li><b>{L('一張主圖', 'One lead visual')}</b>{L('：visual 插槽，緊接在導言後面，放在 Figure 裡，附來源和證據標記。', ': the visual slot, right after the deck, inside a Figure with its source and badge.')}</li>
          <li><b>{L('內文', 'Body')}</b>{L('：最多三段、每段約 100 字（第 7 環四段），用 paragraphs 屬性傳字串。', ': at most three paragraphs of about 100 characters (four for link 7), passed as strings in paragraphs.')}</li>
          <li><b>{L('一個但書', 'One caveat')}</b>{L('（這一段沒有說的事）、', ' (what this does not say), ')}<b>{L('一個行動', 'one action')}</b>{L('（你現在可以做的，附上它背後的證據標記）。', ' (what you can do now, with the badge of the evidence behind it).')}</li>
          <li><b>{L('一行交棒', 'One hand-off line')}</b>{L('，把讀者交給下一章。', ' that hands the reader to the next chapter.')}</li>
          <li>{L('haze 只在第 1–4、6 環和綠燈那一拍打開；它只有一種濃度，不會跟著倒數變。第 5 環沒有畫面色彩，也沒有霧。', 'haze is on only for links 1–4 and 6 and the green beat; it has one density and never follows the countdown. Link 5 carries no scene colour and no haze.')}</li>
          <li>{L('健康章節（第 1–6 環、綠燈、接起來）不放價格和購買按鈕。', 'No price and no purchase button in links 1–6, the green beat or the chain board.')}</li>
        </ol>
        <p class="meta">{L('建置時 Chapter 會對超出預算的導言和段落印出警告（[chapter budget]）；算錢那一章可以用 budget={false} 關掉。', 'At build time Chapter prints a warning ([chapter budget]) for a deck or paragraph over budget; the money chapter can switch it off with budget={false}.')}</p>
      </div>
      <pre class="sg-code" tabindex="0"><code>{`---
import home from '@/i18n/pages/home';
import { localize } from '@/i18n/pages/_copy';
const t = localize(home, locale);
---
<Base locale={locale} title="…" home money>
  <CountdownRail slot="rail" locale={locale} />

  <Chapter locale={locale} id="link-3" link={3} tone="night"
    kicker={t.link3.kicker}            {/* 紅燈 · 剩 64 秒 */}
    title={t.link3.title}
    lead={t.link3.deck}
    paragraphs={t.link3.body}
    caveat={t.link3.caveat}
    handoff={t.link3.handoff}
    moreHref={href('/evidence/#link-3', locale)}
    haze>
    <StreetScene slot="art" locale={locale} frame="paused" />
    <Figure slot="visual" locale={locale} empty
      title={t.link3.figure} who={t.link3.who}>
      <EmptyChart locale={locale} title={t.link3.chartTitle} />
    </Figure>
    <Fragment slot="action">
      <p>{t.link3.action}
        <a href={href('/unmeasured/#ask', locale)}>…</a></p>
    </Fragment>
  </Chapter>
</Base>`}</code></pre>
    </div>
