    <Block name="StanceBox / NotClaimedList" file="ui/StanceBox.astro · ui/NotClaimedList.astro" wide code={`<StanceBox locale={locale} kind="not-saying" items={['等一個紅燈會生病。', …]} />
<StanceBox locale={locale} kind="change-mind"><p>…</p></StanceBox>

{/* /evidence/#not-claimed：由 claims-policy 產生 */}
<NotClaimedList locale={locale} items={claimRuleList
  .filter((r) => r.kind === 'do-not-claim')
  .map((r) => ({ claim: r.rule[locale], why: r.why[locale], instead: r.instead?.[locale] }))} />`}>
      <Fragment slot="note"><p>{L('StanceBox 是放在推論旁邊、永遠打開的兩個框：「我們沒有說」（實線）和「什麼會讓我們改口」（虛線，因為它是關於一個推論的承諾）。NotClaimedList 是「我們不會說的話」：每一句劃掉，後面一行說為什麼。刪除線用 s 元素，每一項前面有給螢幕閱讀器的「我們不會說：」，因為多數閱讀器不會唸出刪除線。', 'StanceBox is the pair of always-open boxes beside the inference: “what we are not saying” (solid) and “what would change our mind” (dashed, because it is a promise about an inference). NotClaimedList is “what we will not say”: each sentence struck through, followed by one line of why. The strike uses the s element, and every item carries a screen-reader prefix “We will not say:”, because most readers do not announce a strike-through.')}</p></Fragment>
      <div class="grid" style="--min: 18rem; --grid-gap: var(--sp-6)">
