          <StanceBox locale={locale} kind="change-mind"><p>{L('示意文字：寫出哪一種量測結果會讓這一環不成立，以及我們會怎麼改。', 'Placeholder: say which measurement would make this link fail, and what we would then change.')}</p></StanceBox>
