<script> panel.dataset.verdict = 'C'; </script>          {/* 切換狀態：標籤、圖示、色調跟著變 */}`}>
        <Fragment slot="note">
          <p>{L('試算結果有三種（V36），每一種都先用一句話講結論，再給數字：A 打得平（乾淨色調、綠色行人號誌）、B 買得起但每個月多花一點（中性色調、約等號）、C 以現在的條件打不平（廢氣色調、不等號，加上「可以先做的事」）。三種靠文字和圖示區分，不只靠顏色。C 是一個完整的答案，不是錯誤訊息。', 'A calculator answers in one of three ways (V36), each stating its conclusion in a sentence before the number: A it adds up (clean tone, the green walking signal), B affordable to buy but a little more each month (neutral tone, an about-equal mark), C on today’s terms it does not add up (exhaust tone, a not-equal mark, plus “what you can do first”). They are told apart by words and glyph, not colour alone. C is a complete answer, not an error message.')}</p>
          <p>{L('deadline 插槽只在結果是 A 的時候出現：倒數天數只給算得過來的人看，而且一定和縣市的名額狀態放在一起（R10）。', 'The deadline slot is rendered only while the verdict is A: a day count is shown only to readers for whom it adds up, and always with their city’s quota status beside it (R10).')}</p>
        </Fragment>
        <div class="grid" style="--min: 17rem">
