          </ResultPanel>
          <ResultPanel locale={locale} verdict="B" sentence={L('示意句子：買的時候差不多，但每個月大約多花一點。值不值得，由你決定。', 'Sample sentence: about the same to buy, but a little more each month. Whether that is worth it is your call.')} title={L('每個月多花（示意）', 'More each month (sample)')} prefix="NT$" value="200" sample>
            <p slot="deadline">{L('這一行不會出現在結果 B。', 'This line never appears in verdict B.')}</p>
          </ResultPanel>
          <ResultPanel locale={locale} verdict="C" sentence={L('示意句子：買的時候還差一截，每個月也不會比較省。我們不會叫你硬換。', 'Sample sentence: there is still a gap at purchase, and it is no cheaper to run. We will not tell you to force it.')} title={L('買的時候還差（示意）', 'Still short at purchase (sample)')} prefix="NT$" value="9,000" sample>
