  <!-- ================================================================ MONEY / DATE STATE -->
  <Section id="money" eyebrow="12" title={L('日期狀態與補助', 'Date state and subsidies')} rule lead={L('這個靜態網站會在 12 月 31 日的兩邊被閱讀。所有跟日期有關的文案，都由同一個模組決定現在是哪一種狀態，並且在瀏覽器裡用今天的日期重新判斷。', 'This static site will be read on both sides of 31 December. One module decides which state every date-dependent sentence is in, and re-evaluates it in the browser from today’s date.')}>
    <Block name="site-state" file="lib/site-state.ts · lib/site-state.client.ts" wide code={`// 建置時（Astro frontmatter、Node）
import { snapshot, moneyState, todayInTaipei } from '@/lib/site-state.data';
const state = moneyState(todayInTaipei(), 'kaohsiung', snapshot);
// state.id → 'A-city-exhausted'   state.city.asOf → '2026-08-11'   state.mayShowDayCount → false

// 頁面：<Base money> 會印出快照並載入瀏覽器端的重新判斷
<p data-money-when="static">…絕對日期，任何時候讀都成立…</p>   {/* 沒有 JavaScript 時只顯示這個 */}
<p data-money-when="A">…</p>  <p data-money-when="B">…</p>  <p data-money-when="C D">…</p>
<p data-money-state="A-city-open" data-money-template="{city}：還有名額（{date} 查）。"></p>
<span data-money-fill="daysSince"></span>
<Select id="city" … data-money-city />                        {/* 讀者的縣市 */}`}>
      <Fragment slot="note">
        <p>{L('狀態有這幾種：到 12 月 31 日為止是 A（還沒選縣市／縣市還有名額／只剩汰舊或特定身分／名額沒公布／已用完／已截止／查不到）；之後到線上申請截止是 B；再之後、沒有任何新方案定案是 C；資料庫裡出現 2027 年之後才開始的方案就是 D。縣市的錢用完是一種狀態，不是註腳。', 'The states: up to 31 December it is A (no city chosen / the city has places / only scrappage or certain groups left / quota not published / used up / closed / could not be checked); from then to the filing deadline, B; after that with nothing confirmed, C; and D once a programme starting after 2026 is in the registry. A city’s money running out is a state, not a footnote.')}</p>
        <p><b>{L('怎麼避免顯示過期的狀態：', 'How a stale state is avoided: ')}</b>{L('（1）建置時把每一種狀態的文案都印出來，各自標上它成立的階段，另外有一句 static：只有絕對日期和查證日，任何時候讀都成立。（2）Base 在第一次繪製前用今天的台灣日期設定 html 的 data-money-phase，CSS 只顯示對的那一句；沒有 JavaScript 就只顯示 static。（3）需要數字或縣市的部分，由瀏覽器端的模組用頁面裡的小快照重算，讀者選縣市、或隔夜回到分頁時再算一次。（4）建置之後才用完的名額，瀏覽器不會知道，所以每個狀態都帶查證日，超過三週會加上「可能已經變了」，倒數天數也會收起來。', '(1) The build prints the copy for every state, each marked with the phase it is true in, plus one static sentence with absolute dates and the check date that is true whenever it is read. (2) Before first paint, Base sets data-money-phase on html from today’s date in Taiwan and CSS shows only the matching sentence; with no JavaScript only static shows. (3) Anything that needs a number or a city is recomputed by the browser module from a small snapshot in the page, again when the reader picks a city or returns to a tab left open overnight. (4) The browser cannot know about quota used up after the build, so every status carries its check date; after three weeks it adds “this may have changed” and the day count is withdrawn.')}</p>
        <p>{L('下面的元件都接在同一個狀態上。用這排按鈕預覽不同的日期（只有這一頁有，正式頁面一律用今天的日期）。', 'The components below all hang off the same state. Use these buttons to preview other dates (this page only; real pages always use today’s date).')}</p>
      </Fragment>
      <div class="sg-dates" data-sg-dates>
        <span class="meta">{L('預覽日期', 'Preview date')}</span>
        {[['', L('今天', 'Today')], ['2026-12-31', '2026-12-31'], ['2027-01-05', '2027-01-05'], ['2027-02-14', '2027-02-14']].map(([d, label]) => <button type="button" class="sg-date" data-date={d} aria-pressed={d === '' ? 'true' : 'false'}>{label}</button>)}
      </div>
      <div class="grid" style="--min: 19rem; --grid-gap: var(--sp-7)">
        <div class="stack" style="--stack: var(--sp-4)">
          <p class="meta">MoneyBanner + Select data-money-city</p>
          <Select id="sg-money-city" label={L('你住在哪個縣市？', 'Which city or county do you live in?')} options={cityOptions} value="" data-money-city />
          <MoneyBanner locale={locale} tone="box" />
        </div>
        <div class="stack" style="--stack: var(--sp-4)">
          <p class="meta">SubsidyTimeline (V19)</p>
          <SubsidyTimeline locale={locale} />
        </div>
      </div>
    </Block>

