  <Fragment slot="taipei"> … 金額、條件，每個數字附查證日 … </Fragment>
</TileMap>`}>
      <Fragment slot="note">
        <p>{L(`22 個縣市的磚塊地圖（V41）。這裡的狀態不是示意：取自資料庫（${formatDate(snapshot.checkedOn, 'zh-TW', true)} 查），由 site-state 依今天的日期判斷。狀態用色塊的花紋和文字區分：有名額（實心）、只限汰舊或特定身分（斜紋）、已用完或已截止（空格加一道斜線）、查不到（虛線加問號，絕對不會顯示成 0）。藍圖列了四種；資料庫裡有不少縣市「方案還在進行、但剩餘名額沒有公布」，寫成「有名額」不對，所以多了第五種「名額沒公布」（圓環）。`, `The 22 cities and counties as a tile map (V41). The states here are not sample data: they come from the registry (checked ${formatDate(snapshot.checkedOn, 'en', true)}) through site-state for today’s date. States are told apart by a swatch pattern and a word: places left (solid), scrappage or certain groups only (hatched), used up or closed (an empty swatch with a strike), could not be checked (dashed with a question mark, never shown as zero). The blueprint lists four; the registry has many counties whose programme is running with no published remaining quota, and calling those “places left” would be wrong, so there is a fifth, “places not published” (a ring).`)}</p>
        <p>{L('每一塊是連到下方明細的連結。有 JavaScript 時明細變成跟著選取走的一格；沒有的時候是一份完整的清單。用以縣市 id 命名的插槽放金額與條件。360px 時是四欄、不需要橫向捲動。', 'Each tile links to its detail row below. With JavaScript the rows become one panel that follows the selection; without it they are a complete list. Put amounts and conditions in a slot named after the jurisdiction id. Four columns at 360px, no sideways scrolling.')}</p>
      </Fragment>
