  <Section id="copy" eyebrow="15" title={L('文案與分享圖', 'Copy and share cards')} rule lead={L('文案怎麼放、怎麼被檢查，以及分享圖怎麼產生。', 'Where copy lives, how it is checked, and how share cards are made.')}>
