// src/i18n/copy-allowlist.json       以（字串 id, 規則 id）為鍵，一定要寫理由
{ "id": "home.link5.honesty", "rule": "associations-not-causes-tw",
  "reason": "這一句是在說研究看到的是『有關』不是『造成』。", "reviewedBy": "…", "reviewedOn": "2026-11-25" }`}>
      <Fragment slot="note">
        <ul>
          <li>{L('每一頁的文案放在 src/i18n/pages/<頁面>.ts，預設匯出一棵樹，葉子是中英各一的字串。共用的介面字串在 ui.ts。.astro 頁面裡不寫中文。', 'Each page’s copy lives in src/i18n/pages/<page>.ts: a default-exported tree whose leaves hold the string in both languages. Shared interface strings are in ui.ts. No Chinese is written in a .astro page.')}</li>
          <li>{L('字串 id 是「模組名.路徑」，陣列用索引。id 要穩定：允許清單是用它當鍵。', 'A string id is module name plus dotted path, arrays by index. Keep ids stable: the allow-list is keyed by them.')}</li>
          <li>{L('npm run check 會跑 scripts/check-copy.mjs：把 claims-policy.ts 的 flagCopy() 套在每一個字串上，再加三個語氣檢查（寫「台灣」不寫「臺灣」、用「你」不用「您」、沒有驚嘆號）。有比對到、而且沒有在允許清單裡，就失敗。', 'npm run check runs scripts/check-copy.mjs: flagCopy() from claims-policy.ts over every string, plus three voice checks (台灣 not 臺灣, 你 never 您, no exclamation marks). A match that is not in the allow-list fails the check.')}</li>
