          <li><code>node scripts/check-copy.mjs --list</code> {L('列出所有字串 id。R1–R16 裡機器查不到的規則，仍然要由人檢查。', 'prints every string id. The rules in R1–R16 that a machine cannot check still need a person.')}</li>
