              'Body text is set at a line-height of 1.6 and about 66 characters a line. Emphasis is a real <em>italic</em> in English and bold in Chinese, because Chinese has no italic. Units stay attached to their numbers, such as 125 cc, and dashes — like this one — come from the Latin font in English and from the CJK font in Chinese.',
