</EvidenceChain>`}>
      <Fragment slot="note">
        <p>{L('上面「接起來」那一章就是證據板：傳入 question，鏈的最後就是一個沒有接上的環（軌道斷開、節點是空心的問號、戴「沒人量過」），接著是 reveal 插槽。reveal 是原生 details，預設關著，按鈕旁邊就先掛著「我們的推論」；讀者先看到六件事和那個問題，才看到結論。collapseSources 把每一環的來源收在「看來源」後面；/evidence/ 不要用它，並且可以設 revealOpen。', 'The “joining it up” chapter above is the chain board: pass question and the chain ends in an open link (the rail breaks, the node is a hollow question mark, it wears “nobody has measured this”), followed by the reveal slot. The reveal is a native details element, closed by default, with “our inference” shown beside its button; the reader meets the six facts and the question before any conclusion. collapseSources puts each link’s citations behind “see sources”; leave it off on /evidence/, where revealOpen may also be set.')}</p>
        <p>{L('不傳 question 時是傳統的七環：最後一環脫離軌道、換成綠色並可放行動按鈕。每一環的節點和它往下的軌道，依證據線型畫。', 'Without question it is the classic chain of seven: the last link is detached from the rail, turns green and can hold a call to action. Each node and the rail below it are drawn in the line style of that link’s evidence.')}</p>
