      </Figure>

      <Figure locale={locale} number={7} title={L('把人和車分開之後', 'After people and traffic are separated')} subtitle={L(`行人穿越時的暴露濃度（${units.ugm3}）`, `Exposure while crossing (${units.ugm3})`)} caption={L('BeforeAfterChart：每列兩個點，一條線連起來。', 'BeforeAfterChart: two dots per row joined by a line.')} sample>
