      <Fragment slot="note">
        <p>{L('網站的招牌圖（V8）：一張畫得完整的圖，有面板、座標軸、刻度、格線和紅燈轉綠燈的色條，但沒有任何資料點，因為沒有人量過。它必須看起來是刻意的，不是壞掉：外框和其他圖一樣完整；y 軸只標出 0 在哪裡，不編造刻度；每個面板角落寫著「無資料」，被截圖裁切之後仍然讀得出來。沒有線、沒有點、沒有任何佔位的形狀。', 'The site’s signature graphic (V8): a completely drawn chart with panels, axes, ticks, gridlines and the red-then-green phase bar, and no data marks at all, because nobody has measured it. It has to look deliberate, never broken: the frame is as finished as any other chart; the y axis shows only where zero would be and invents no scale; each panel says “no data” in its corner, so a cropped screenshot still reads. No line, no dots, no placeholder shape.')}</p>
        <p>{L('Figure 的 empty 狀態：圖說預設是「這不是版面錯誤。這張圖的數據不存在。」；來源那一行換成「沒人量過」標記；who 說誰量得出來（空白後面一定要接這一句）。螢幕閱讀器會讀到：圖的名稱、你給的 desc，加上「這張圖是刻意留白的…」，以及一張每一格都是「無資料」的資料表。ChartShell 的 empty 屬性就是做這件事，自己寫 render 函式的人可以直接用。', 'Figure’s empty state: the caption defaults to “This is not a layout error. The data for this chart does not exist.”; the source line is replaced by the “nobody has measured this” badge; who says who could measure it (a gap is always followed by that). A screen reader gets the graphic’s name, your desc plus “this chart is empty on purpose…”, and a data table whose every cell reads “no data”. ChartShell’s empty prop is what does this, for anyone writing their own render function.')}</p>
      </Fragment>
      <div class="grid" style="--min: 20rem; --grid-gap: var(--sp-7)">
